	(text "Single 3.3 V supply mode: V5 and VIO33 are tied to VDD33 (datasheet Table 1-1).\nPins 6, 7 and 8 are joined at the pads; C3 100 nF sits at pin 6 and C2 2.2 uF is the bulk/LDO output cap.\nY1 has no external load capacitors: the CH572 provides programmable internal load capacitance.\nANT (pin 5) drives the PCB antenna directly, as on OpenDongle.\nNRST is PA8, the default RST pin (CFG_RST_PIN_EN = 0); set CFG_RESET_EN to enable it."
		(at 101.6 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3962b374-e7ac-4b5c-9517-3ec7711f9554")
	)
