  (text "R1 holds PA1 low when J1 pad 8 is left open. PA1 is the ROM boot strap\n(PA1 high + PA0 low at power-on enters USB/UART ISP), USB D+ and SWCLK."
    (at 167.64 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0c9469ff-2b63-458c-8089-26dc47c32c1c")
  )
  (text "J1 castellated edge: 1.0 mm half-holes on a 0.1 in grid, three per edge.\nViewed from the top with the antenna at the bottom, pads count\ncounter-clockwise from the top-left. All I/O is 3.3 V.\n1 GND (left edge)\n2 UART_TX: PA3, module out (left edge)\n3 UART_RX: PA2, module in (left edge)\n4 NRST: PA8, module in (right edge)\n5 VCC in, 3.3 to 6.0 V (right edge)\n6 GND (right edge)\n7 SWDIO: PA0, also USB D- (top edge)\n8 SWCLK: PA1, also USB D+ (top edge)\n9 WAKE: PA4, module out (top edge)"
    (at 195.58 93.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "628018c5-8474-4e02-8294-02490080157a")
  )
